                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2903610,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "One thing you have to do while you're here is go dolphin watching. On our boat trips, we pretty well guarantee you'll see dolphins. If you don't, you can repeat the trip free of charge. We organize daily trips for just €35. Unfortunately, there aren't any places left for this afternoon's trip, but come and see me to book for later in the week.",
