          },
          {
            "id": 2903755,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Then on Thursdays, we organize a cycle trip, which will give you all the fun of biking without the effort. We'll take you and your bike up to the top of Mount Lanna and leave you to bike back. It's a 700 meter drop in just 20 kilometers, so this isn't really for inexperienced cyclists as you'll be going pretty fast. And if it's a clear day, you'll have fantastic views. On our local craft tour, you can find out about the traditional activities in the island.",
