          {
            "id": 2903848,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "And the best thing about this trip is that it's completely free. You'll be taken to a factory where jewelry is made and also a ceramics center. If you want, you can buy some of the products, but that's entirely up to you. The trip starts after lunch on Thursday, and you'll return by 6PM. If you're interested in astronomy, you may already know that the island's one of the best places in the world to observe the night sky.",
